# Shop / Shopify

- Lookup: `docs/SHOP.md`. Contract: `docs/AGENT.md`.
- Enable with `pages.shop` + SITE_SPEC/`shop.ts` copy; home teaser via `sections.home.shopPreview`.
- Credentials: `PUBLIC_SHOPIFY_*` env (or empty `shopify-public.ts` stubs). Never Admin `shpat_`/`shpss_` in repo.
- Catalog is Storefront API at build time; cart/checkout in the browser; no React/SSR/Hydrogen unless explicitly requested.
- Site-specific install pricing / WhatsApp CTAs → config (`addonPricing`, `product.secondaryCtas`) or `components/site/*` — not hardcoded in platform components.
- Semantic classes only (`text-fg*`, `surface-card`, `btn-accent`).
